          <li>Rimfolk_Camp_BeastShow</li>
          <li>Rimfolk_Camp_Catchers</li>
        </camps>
        <plan>Rimfolk_Plan_BoutRing</plan>
        <honours>the bond freely given, a fair bout and the stranger who beats them</honours>
        <fears>the leash, a beast ill-used and a bout won by a trick</fears>
        <sayings>
          <li>A bond is not a leash.</li>
          <li>Win their trust and they will win your battles.</li>
          <li>To be beaten fairly is an honour.</li>
          <li>Every egg is a road not walked yet.</li>
          <li>Never fight beside a beast you have not fed.</li>
        </sayings>
        <townGoods>
          <Kibble>60~140</Kibble>
          <Hay>100~220</Hay>
